<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

    <%- include('partials/head', {
        pageTitle: "Technology Services FAQ | SMK Digitals",
        pageDescription: "Learn about SMK Digitals services including custom software development, web development, AI solutions, business process automation, digital systems, and technology consulting.",
        canonicalPath: "/faq"
    }) %>

    <!-- FAQ Structured Data -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What custom software can SMK DIGITALS build for my business?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS develops custom software around the specific needs and workflows of your business. Solutions can include internal business systems, web applications, dashboards, customer or staff portals, management platforms, workflow tools, and other tailored software."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What type of websites does SMK DIGITALS develop?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS develops professional websites based on the goals of your business. This can include company websites, service websites, landing pages, portfolio websites, and more advanced web-based solutions designed to strengthen your online presence and support business growth."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How can SMK DIGITALS use AI in my business?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS helps businesses identify practical opportunities to use artificial intelligence. Depending on the business need, AI can support customer service, productivity, information management, decision-making, repetitive tasks, internal workflows, and other business operations."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What business processes can SMK DIGITALS automate?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS can help automate repetitive and time-consuming business processes such as data capture, customer enquiries, notifications, document workflows, administrative tasks, reporting, internal processes, and other recurring activities where automation can reduce manual work."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What digital systems can SMK DIGITALS build for my business?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "SMK DIGITALS can design digital systems that help businesses organise information, manage workflows, improve operations, and connect different parts of the business. The exact solution depends on the problem, process, and requirements of the organisation."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How does SMK DIGITALS technology consulting work?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Technology consulting starts with understanding your business, current processes, challenges, and goals. SMK DIGITALS then helps identify suitable technologies and recommends a practical approach for using software, AI, automation, web technology, or digital systems to address those needs."
                }
            }
        ]
    }
    </script>

</head>

<body>

    <%- include('partials/navbar', { active: active }) %>

    <main>

        <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
        <section id="how-it-works">

            <h2>How We Turn Business Problems Into Technology Solutions</h2>

            <p>
                We start by understanding your business before recommending
                technology. Our process helps us identify the problem, determine
                the right solution, and build technology around what your business
                actually needs.
            </p>

            <div class="flip-boxes-container">

                <!-- Step 1 -->
                <div class="flip-box">
                    <div class="flip-box-inner">

                        <div class="flip-box-front">
                            <h3>Step 1</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flip-box-back">
                            <h3>Understand &amp; Discover</h3>

                            <p>
                                We begin by understanding your business, how you
                                currently operate, the challenges you are experiencing,
                                and what you want to achieve. This helps us identify
                                where technology can create meaningful value.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="flip-box">
                    <div class="flip-box-inner">

                        <div class="flip-box-front">
                            <h3>Step 2</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flip-box-back">
                            <h3>Design &amp; Build</h3>

                            <p>
                                Once the problem is understood, we determine the
                                appropriate technology solution. This could involve
                                custom software, a website or web application,
                                artificial intelligence, automation, a digital system,
                                or a combination of technologies.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="flip-box">
                    <div class="flip-box-inner">

                        <div class="flip-box-front">
                            <h3>Step 3</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flip-box-back">
                            <h3>Launch &amp; Improve</h3>

                            <p>
                                We implement the solution, test that it works as
                                intended, and help your business put it into use.
                                Where needed, we can continue improving and supporting
                                the solution as your business and technology needs evolve.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- FAQ -->
        <section id="FAQ">

            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

            <p>
                Learn more about the technology services we offer and how
                SMK DIGITALS can help your business.
            </p>


            <div class="faq-item">

                <h3>
                    What custom software can SMK DIGITALS build for my business?
                    <span>?</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We develop custom software around the specific needs and
                    workflows of your business. This can include internal business
                    systems, web applications, dashboards, customer or staff portals,
                    management platforms, workflow tools, and other tailored software.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="faq-item">

                <h3>
                    What type of websites does SMK DIGITALS develop?
                    <span>?</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We develop professional websites based on the goals of your
                    business. This can include company websites, service websites,
                    landing pages, portfolio websites, and more advanced web-based
                    solutions designed to strengthen your online presence and
                    support business growth.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="faq-item">

                <h3>
                    How can SMK DIGITALS use AI in my business?
                    <span>?</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We help businesses identify practical opportunities to use
                    artificial intelligence. Depending on your needs, AI can support
                    customer service, productivity, information management,
                    decision-making, repetitive tasks, internal workflows, and
                    other business operations.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="faq-item">

                <h3>
                    What business processes can SMK DIGITALS automate?
                    <span>?</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We can help automate repetitive and time-consuming processes
                    such as data capture, customer enquiries, notifications,
                    document workflows, administrative tasks, reporting, internal
                    processes, and other recurring activities where automation can
                    reduce manual work.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="faq-item">

                <h3>
                    What digital systems can SMK DIGITALS build for my business?
                    <span>?</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We can design digital systems that help your business organise
                    information, manage workflows, improve operations, and connect
                    different parts of the business. The exact solution depends on
                    the problem, process, and requirements of your organisation.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="faq-item">

                <h3>
                    How does SMK DIGITALS technology consulting work?
                    <span>?</span>
                </h3>

                <p class="answer">
                    We start by understanding your business, current processes,
                    challenges, and goals. We then help identify suitable technologies
                    and recommend a practical approach for using software, AI,
                    automation, web technology, or digital systems to address
                    those needs.
                </p>

            </div>


            <a href="/contact" class="btn">
                Discuss Your Business Needs
            </a>

        </section>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <%- include('partials/scripts') %>

</body>

</html>
